# lid5.config -- Phase 4b Task 4 (BlstmSpectralLid / Algo 5) fixture.
# Derived from phase0/1_worker_1.config: Algo_choice 5, plain scoring path
# (BLSTM_window 0), forced-low SAD decision thresholds so the LTSV-based SAD
# yields ONE big SPEECH segment per file (guarantees the LID scoring loop runs;
# non-vacuity), no output convolution, tiny smoothing so the segment survives.
# The real 33,671-weight SAD net (BLSTM topology) is loaded via NNweights_config1.bin.
numOuterThreads 8
numInnerThreads 1
multiConfigResultsOutputFile MultiConfigResults_Plot_worker_1.mat
Display_Height 0
Display_MillisecondsPerPixel 64
Display_WaveAll_Height 50
Display_WaveAll_Width 1000
